Description: signed relay directory service for Activity-Relay
 Activity-Relay Directory provides the versioned signed lifecycle directory,
 local operator administration, bounded public relay views, SQLite persistence,
 retention controls, and database-growth safeguards used by Activity-Relay
 deployments.
